1
00:00:00,205 --> 00:00:03,705
...what are you gonna do? Knock and say
to Mrs. Bell, "Fan of your husband.

2
00:00:03,876 --> 00:00:06,716
(Howard:)Can I come in and watch him
invent the telephone?"

3
00:00:06,879 --> 00:00:09,719
(Raj:)Mrs. Bell was deaf.
She's not even gonna hear you knock.

4
00:00:10,883 --> 00:00:13,213
(Sheldon:)I have a solution.
First, go into the future...

5
00:00:13,385 --> 00:00:16,305
(Sheldon:)- ...and obtain a cloaking device.
- Ooh. How far into the future?

6
00:00:16,472 --> 00:00:19,892
If I remember, Kirk will steal
a cloaking device from the Romulans...

7
00:00:20,058 --> 00:00:22,188
(Sheldon:)...on stardate 5027.3...

8
00:00:22,352 --> 00:00:26,562
...which would be January 10th, 2328,
by pre-Federation reckoning.

9
00:00:27,566 --> 00:00:32,406
(Leonard:)Okay, I am setting the dials
for January 10th, 2328.

10
00:00:32,571 --> 00:00:35,911
(Leonard:)Here we go into the future.

11
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:58,020
(Leonard:)That was fun.

